      "license": "CERN-OHL-W-2.0",
      "lineage": [
        {
          "source": "The set-up (rigid) paper box: a board shell covered with a pasted paper wrap, an industrial craft since the nineteenth century; the geometry is generated here from inside dimensions and the stock calipers — no manufacturer's drawing is reproduced",
